flowchart LR
  accTitle: Versioned cross-bundle state handoffs
  accDescr: Producers emit immutable typed events carrying task identity, expected aggregate versions, provenance, and evidence references. The receiving governor evaluates the request within its authority. The coordinator checks versions and commits an allowed transition. Observed outcomes may later support a separate attributable learning update.
  P[Producer and proposal]
  E[Immutable typed event]
  G[Receiving governor]
  V[Version and invariant checks]
  C[Commit transition receipt]
  O[Observed and verified outcome]
  L[Attributable policy update]
  P --> E --> G --> V --> C --> O --> L
  L -. future policy version .-> P
  classDef proposal fill:#F4F4F4,stroke:#888888,color:#1C1C1E,stroke-width:1.2px
  classDef control fill:#EAF4FB,stroke:#1A4A8A,color:#1C1C1E,stroke-width:1.4px
  classDef durable fill:#EEF7EE,stroke:#27AE60,color:#1C1C1E,stroke-width:1.4px
  class P,E proposal
  class G,V control
  class C,O,L durable
